# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║   CYBER AUTOMATION ENGINEER  —  app.py                      ║
# ║   Python Backend: Flask + FastAPI (choose one)              ║
# ║   Features:                                                  ║
# ║     • /api/posts      — blog post JSON feed                  ║
# ║     • /api/profile    — author profile JSON                  ║
# ║     • /sitemap.xml    — auto-generated XML sitemap           ║
# ║     • SEO meta-tag injection helper                          ║
# ║     • Google Blogger / static-site compatibility notes       ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

# DEPLOYMENT OPTIONS
# # ──────────────────
#   1. GitHub Pages / Netlify (static)
#      - Deploy index.html + style.css + script.js only.
#      - No Python backend required; /api/* calls fall back
#        to the embedded BLOG_POSTS array in script.js.
#
#   2. Flask (lightweight, self-hosted)
#      - pip install flask flask-cors
#      - python app.py
#      - Serves static files from ./static/ and API from /api/
#
#   3. FastAPI (production, async)
#      - pip install fastapi uvicorn[standard] jinja2
#      - uvicorn app:fastapi_app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
#
#   4. Google Blogger / Blogspot
#      - Use index.html as a Blogger custom template.
#      - Replace <b:section> placeholders as needed.
#      - Remove <script src="script.js"> and inline the JS
#        in a <script> tag within the template.
#      - Host style.css on a CDN (e.g. jsDelivr via GitHub).
#      - /api/* endpoints are NOT available on Blogger;
#        BLOG_POSTS[] in script.js acts as the data layer.
#
# DEPENDENCIES
# # ────────────
#   Flask  : pip install flask flask-cors
#   FastAPI: pip install fastapi uvicorn[standard] jinja2
#   Sitemap: uses Python stdlib only (xml.etree.ElementTree)

